<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Offer Letter</title>

  <style>
    /* ================= PAGE SETUP ================= */
    body {
      width: 700px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      font-family: "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #000;
    }

    p {
      margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    }

    /* ================= HEADER ================= */
    .company-header {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .company-header strong {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    /* ================= TITLE ================= */
    .title {
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }

    /* ================= SECTION HEADINGS ================= */
    .section-title {
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }

    /* ================= TERMS ================= */
    ol {
      margin: 5px 0 15px 20px;
      padding: 0;
    }

    li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    /* ================= FOOTER ================= */
    .footer {
      margin-top: 60px;
      font-size: 11px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* ================= WATERMARK ================= */
    .watermark {
      position: fixed;
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      width: 420px;
      opacity: 0.06;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-30deg);
      z-index: -1;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- WATERMARK -->
  <img src="http://localhost:3000/public/images/logo.png" class="watermark" />

  <!-- COMPANY HEADER -->
  <div class="company-header">
    <strong>Techrover Solutions</strong><br />
    406, Milestone Complex, Zanzarda Road, Junagadh, Gujarat-362001<br />
    [P] +91 9825997073 | [E] info@techroversolutions.com | [W] www.techroversolutions.com<br />
    CIN - U72900GJ2020OPC113964
  </div>

  <!-- DATE -->
  <p>Date: <%= joinedAt %></p>

  <!-- ADDRESS -->
  <p>
    To,<br />
    <%= name %><br />
    Junagadh-362001
  </p>

  <!-- TITLE -->
  <p class="title">Offer Letter</p>

  <!-- BODY -->
  <p>Dear <%= firstName %>,</p>

  <p>
    We are pleased an offer to you for a training opportunity at
    <strong>Techrover Solutions Training Center</strong>. We believe that your skills,
    talents, and potential will make a valuable contribution to our organization.
    This offer letter outlines the details of your training program, which is set to
    commence on Dt. <%= joinedAt %>.
  </p>

  <p class="section-title">Training Program Overview:</p>

  <p>
    During your training (<%= duration %>), you will have the opportunity to gain
    hands-on experience and knowledge in <%= technology %>. Our program is designed
    to provide you with practical skills and insights to help you develop your career
    in this field.
  </p>

  <p class="section-title">Terms and Conditions:</p>

  <ol>
    <li><strong>Attendance:</strong> You are expected to attend all training sessions, workshops, and meetings as required.</li>
    <li><strong>Confidentiality:</strong> You will be required to sign a confidentiality agreement to protect the company's proprietary information.</li>
    <li><strong>Evaluation:</strong> Your performance during the training program will be regularly reviewed to ensure your progress aligns with our training objectives.</li>
    <li><strong>Compensation:</strong> <%= compensation %></li>
    <li><strong>Employment:</strong> This training program does not guarantee employment with Techrover Solutions Pvt. Ltd. Any potential employment opportunities will be discussed upon successful completion of the training.</li>
  </ol>

  <p>
    If you have any questions or need further information, please feel free to contact
    <%= contactPerson %> at Junagadh office.
  </p>

  <p>
    Congratulations on your selection for our training program. We believe it will be
    a mutually rewarding experience.
  </p>

  <!-- SIGNATURE -->
  <p>Sincerely,</p>

  <p>
    <strong><%= signerName %></strong><br />
    <%= signerDesignation %><br />
    Techrover Solutions
  </p>

  <p>
    B6, Milestone Complex,<br />
    Zanzarda Road, Junagadh<br />
    M. <%= signerMobile %>
  </p>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <div class="footer">
    <strong>Techrover Solutions</strong>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
